--     HK$60,000 per year (source 3190, the scheme's own page, fetched first-hand
--     today; automatic consideration; ambassador role with the Global Engagement
--     Office). Description sentence replaced in place.
-- (b) NEW 1006 PolyU STARS Scholarship for Non-Local Students (rel 10): the
--     separately-named talent-based scheme sitting next to 651's academic entry
--     scholarships, read first-hand on its official page (source 3191 — six
--     2027/28 tiers published as subject to approval, from a renewable
--     full-tuition scholarship + HK$60,000/yr allowance down to one-off
--     half-tuition; automatic consideration via the STARS admission route;
--     renewals subject to conditions). deadline_date stores the operative
--     main-round admission close (2027-02-11) with deadline_type=automatic
--     (records 1002/1003 convention); the round dates carry their provenance
--     (verified on PolyU pages 2026-10-23 for record 651's applicant stream).
--     Amount NULL/HKD/year/range with USD 0 (tuition-fraction tiers).
-- (c) 556 CityU renewal CGPA (3.2) re-check attempted: the official
--     /international/ page's search snippet still states 3.2, but the URL
--     redirects to the generic admissions page and snippets are orientation only,
