(723, 72, 1006, 'PolyU STARS Scholarship for Non-Local Students', 'available', 'Talent-based (automatic consideration)', 'Six tiers for 2027/28 (subject to approval): up to a renewable full-tuition scholarship plus a renewable HK$60,000/year allowance, down to one-off half-tuition', true, false, 'Special talents in Sports, Arts and Culture, Leadership and Community Services, or STEM', 'Non-local undergraduate applicants entering through PolyU''s STARS talent-based admission route are considered automatically — no separate scholarship form (apply in the 2027 admission rounds: early round to 17 November 2026, main round to 11 February 2027). Renewable tiers continue subject to the university''s renewal conditions; English is set by the admission requirement for your qualification.', 'https://www.polyu.edu.hk/study/ug/fees-and-scholarships/scholarships/non-local-stars-scholarship', 'https://www.polyu.edu.hk/study/ug/fees-and-scholarships/scholarships/non-local-stars-scholarship', 'verified', '2026-10-30 08:00:00+05');

